&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a high-energy, proactive &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot;&gt;Volume Hiring Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our frontline recruitment operations. In this role, you will own scale—driving &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;153&quot;&gt;100+ monthly hires&lt;/strong&gt; across Operations and frontline teams. You will leverage your existing network of staffing agencies, design mass-sourcing channels, automate recruitment funnels, and lead a team to hit aggressive growth targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
