&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Agency Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Onboard, manage, and hold external staffing agencies and manpower vendors accountable to strict delivery SLAs, candidate quality, and cost targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
