&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;9wd6ee&quot; data-start=&quot;393&quot; data-end=&quot;413&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;414&quot; data-end=&quot;713&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated and energetic &lt;strong&gt;Inside Sales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;466&quot; data-end=&quot;488&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Business Development team at &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Instawork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. In this role, you will connect with local businesses, introduce them to Instawork’s platform, and support them through the onboarding journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;715&quot; data-end=&quot;909&quot;&gt;If you enjoy speaking with people, are confident on calls, and want to build a strong foundation in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;815&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;sales, business development, and partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;, this opportunity is a great starting point.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1xmbd3v&quot; data-start=&quot;911&quot; data-end=&quot;937&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
