&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• ₹25,000 fixed monthly salary&lt;br&gt;• Performance-based daily incentives on top of fixed salary&lt;br&gt;• Full training provided before Day 1 — no prior experience needed&lt;br&gt;• Structured work environment with dedicated Supervisor and Trainer support&lt;br&gt;• Opportunity to be part of a high-growth AI data collection project&lt;br&gt;Shift preference (morning or evening) and location (Airbnb or kitchen) will be discussed and&lt;br&gt;confirmed during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
