&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e7c99a547c815c92-101&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;*Incentive Note:&lt;/strong&gt; Incentives are performance-based and linked to verified conversions, recorded hours generated from your converted businesses, and quality/consistency of execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,2&quot;&gt;. All conversions and hours are subject to verification before payout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,4&quot;&gt;. A detailed slab structure will be shared at the offer stage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
