&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e7c99a547c815c92-105&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Verification:&lt;/strong&gt; Every conversion is verified&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0,2&quot;&gt;. A converted business means a real, reachable business that is scheduled and ready for recording&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e7c99a547c815c92-106&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;⚠️ &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;CRITICAL PERFORMANCE STANDARD:&lt;/strong&gt; Any week with fewer than 50 converted businesses (~8/day) is a failure to execute the core requirement of this role and will result in termination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
