&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;B.E. / B.Tech Graduate&lt;/strong&gt; (All streams welcome; Batch of 2025 or 2026).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in a core leadership or operations role for a &lt;strong&gt;College Fest&lt;/strong&gt;. We are looking for candidates who have managed budgets, logistics, or large teams in a high-pressure environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Expert-level proficiency in Microsoft Excel&lt;/strong&gt; (formulas, data modeling, and pivot tables).&lt;/li&gt;
