&lt;p&gt;We seek a QA Specialist to validate robotic training videos using our automated quality assessment platform. You’ll use existing tools to ensure high-quality training data for robotic manipulation systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daily Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run automated QA platform to grade robotic training videos (A/B/C/D/F scoring)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review quality reports with visibility and motion assessment results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Green/Yellow/Red classification based on automated platform outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag videos requiring manual review when confidence scores are low&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quality Control&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor training data quality using established metrics and thresholds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify common quality issues in robotic clamp operation videos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document quality patterns and maintain consistent standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate daily/weekly quality reports for robotics teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance Expectations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process 50+ videos daily using the automated platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain 95% accuracy in quality validation decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete quality reports within established timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow standard procedures for quality assessment workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
