&lt;p&gt;Essential Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated tools for quality validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of video/image quality concepts&lt;/li&gt;
