&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Instawork, we&#39;re a full staffing platform suite that allows businesses to connect with professionals in a modern, robust way. Our labor marketplace connects over 10M professionals to top Hospitality and Logistics companies across North America, and we&#39;re looking for top talent to help us scale. We have an immediate opening for a Sales Manager with a proven track record of success to join our rapidly growing team. Reporting to the Sales Director, this role is a critical member of the sales leadership team, responsible for coaching reps through every stage of the outbound sales process, including prospecting, qualification, and pipeline building, while using data to spot gaps and drive the fixes that close them. This is a results-driven position built for someone who can build and manage remote software sales teams, and who is as comfortable in a rep&#39;s deal review as they are in a pipeline dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do &amp;amp; Who You Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach reps through the full outbound sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt; (prospecting, qualifying, and building pipeline), with 2+ years of experience building and managing high-performing remote software sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read the data and act on it&lt;/strong&gt;: monitor pipeline, activity, and conversion metrics to spot gaps, then design and execute the coaching, process, or enablement changes that close them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring 5+ years of quota-exceeding experience&lt;/strong&gt; selling mid-enterprise deals, with a track record of overachievement and hitting sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support deals directly&lt;/strong&gt; as senior air cover, managing multiple stakeholder deal cycles and helping the team navigate complex organizations and negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboard and ramp new Account Executives&lt;/strong&gt;, accelerating their time to productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast accurately&lt;/strong&gt; and represent your business clearly to the executive team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with Marketing, Operations, Product, and Engineering to develop and execute initiatives that support the sales org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Know the Instawork platform deeply&lt;/strong&gt; enough to coach reps on value proposition, positioning, and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and evolve the sales playbook&lt;/strong&gt;, driving adoption across your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop future sales leaders&lt;/strong&gt; and share learnings and best practices across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale the organization sustainably&lt;/strong&gt; as the team grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a self-starter who&#39;s passionate about coaching, mentorship, and team management, motivated by helping people grow, self-aware, and high in emotional intelligence. You learn fast, establish credibility quickly, and thrive in a high-growth, rapidly changing marketplace. You&#39;re excited to build a career at a startup disrupting the gig economy, and you&#39;re committed to developing a deep understanding of Instawork&#39;s mission, values, and product.&lt;/p&gt;
