&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IRL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Researchers at UC Berkeley have identified a “100,000-year data gap” - the gulf between what trained AI language models and what physical robots actually have to learn from. Closing that gap is the defining infrastructure challenge of the physical AI era. IRL is Instawork’s answer to it. We deploy skilled workers into real commercial and residential environments - kitchens, warehouses, hotel floors, homes - to capture the high-fidelity task data that the world’s leading Robotics labs use to train their foundation models. Read more &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/sumirmeghani/status/2044707303262237129&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Instawork is building the data engine for the future of physical AI. To do that at scale, we need reliable, high-volume access to businesses across India whose skilled manual work becomes the training data for the next generation of robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Partnerships Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to secure that access — both by hunting new opportunities directly and by brokering relationships with the people who already control access to hundreds of businesses: association presidents, lenders, government officials, and enterprise leaders. Your job is to convert both cold outreach and high-trust institutional relationships into onboarding pathways at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Broker access at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, cultivate, and close relationships with high-leverage intermediaries — presidents of business associations, lenders, banks, politicians, civil servants, and large multinational corporations — who can grant direct, reliable access to hundreds of businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build outbound pipeline.&lt;/strong&gt; Generate leads and open doors through cold calls, email, and LinkedIn — full-cycle, from first outreach to signed partner to collected data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn one relationship into many.&lt;/strong&gt; Convert a single institutional connection into structured, repeatable onboarding pathways for entire clusters of businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the trusted liaison.&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the ongoing point of contact between Instawork Robotics and partners, managing these relationships over time rather than transacting once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate complex stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt; Move fluently across political, institutional, and commercial decision-makers to secure top-level buy-in and remove friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hand off to the field.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with field operations so unlocked networks translate into collected, high-quality data on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
