&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founder Mindset &amp;amp; Bias for Action:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a &quot;get-it-done&quot; attitude and are willing to do whatever it takes to launch a category—whether that’s manually matching shifts, cold-calling early partners, or testing ground-level operational processes. You don&#39;t wait for permission or perfect data; you deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; You think big-picture while staying fiercely grounded in data and execution. You are comfortable with fast iteration, navigating complex requirements, and solving unstructured problems in a rapidly evolving marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-disciplinary Executor:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years in finance, operations, consulting, or high-growth startup environments. You have a proven track record of owning chaotic, ground-level execution and turning early momentum into sustainable success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Analytical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a technical toolkit fueled by AI, using data to unearth new insights, build business cases, and measure the success of your pilots without needing a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Communicator &amp;amp; Evangelist:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to represent Instawork externally to new partners and internally as a driver of cross-functional alignment. You can turn operational friction into scalable processes and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
