es new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- Ability to independently prioritize work, make engineering decisions, and own outcomes with limited oversight.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- Willingness to travel across India and APAC for vendor visits, deployments, and field investigations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
