&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- Instacore has a clear, reliable, and scalable hardware architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- New designs move efficiently from requirements through prototype, validation, and deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- Field failures, wire breakages, and transit damage decline measurably.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- Manufacturing, repair, inventory, and logistics processes are documented and repeatable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- Junior engineers and technicians can assemble, test, and repair units using the systems you establish.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;- Hardware development no longer depends on day-to-day involvement from the broader team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
