&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocate for Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt; – Champion engineering excellence and contribute to continuous improvement in developer tooling and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute Technical Input&lt;/strong&gt; – Provide input on team technical design, balancing short-term delivery with long-term scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Clear Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Communicate effectively through clear PR descriptions and proactively surfacing blockers before they become critical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
