&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;About the Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for experienced Shift Supervisors to oversee evening and night shift operations&lt;br&gt;across our Airbnb, kitchen, and in-office data collection locations in Marathalli. As a Supervisor,&lt;br&gt;you will manage a team of Data Collectors, ensure shift productivity and quality targets are met,&lt;br&gt;and submit all required reports on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your specific shift timing and location will be confirmed during the interview process based on&lt;br&gt;current requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Oversee shift operations for a team of Data Collectors at the assigned location&lt;br&gt;• Monitor productivity and quality in real time throughout the shift&lt;br&gt;• Collect the next day&#39;s task list from the client before the stipulated time and coordinate with&lt;br&gt;the Team Lead&lt;br&gt;• Ensure demo recordings are submitted on time per the daily schedule&lt;br&gt;• Flag quality issues immediately to the Trainer and Team Lead&lt;br&gt;• Maintain shift attendance log and real-time productivity tracking&lt;br&gt;• Submit SOD, MOD, EOD, and Inventory reports for the shift&lt;br&gt;• Coordinate with the Inventory Manager on device availability and equipment issues •&lt;br&gt;Support replacement of underperforming Data Collectors in coordination with the Team&lt;br&gt;Lead&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Minimum 1 year of experience in floor management, team handling, or operations&lt;br&gt;supervision&lt;br&gt;• Graduate preferred — 10+2 minimum&lt;br&gt;• Not a fresher — prior experience in a supervisory or team lead capacity is mandatory&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable working for morning, afternoon or night shifts&lt;br&gt;• Strong attention to detail and ability to monitor multiple tasks simultaneously • Comfortable&lt;br&gt;with report writing and basic digital tools (WhatsApp, Google Sheets, or similar) • Excellent&lt;br&gt;communication and team management skills&lt;br&gt;• Punctual and reliable — must be present for the full duration of the shift&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;What We Offer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ₹27,500 gross monthly salary&lt;br&gt;• Performance-based shift incentives based on team productivity&lt;br&gt;• Structured reporting framework with full Team Lead support&lt;br&gt;• Growth opportunity within a scaling AI data collection operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
